    Synthesis of point-modified mRNA
    Jasmin Hertler1,† , Kaouthar Slama1,† , Benedikt Schober1 , Zeynep Özrendeci1 ,
    Virginie Marchand2 , Yuri Motorin 2,3 and Mark Helm 1,*
    Institute of Pharmaceutical and Biomedical Sciences, Johannes Gutenberg-Universität, Staudinger Weg 5, D-55128
    Mainz, Germany, 2 IMoPA UMR7365 CNRS-UL, BioPole Université de Lorraine, Vandœuvre-lès-Nancy, France and
