    In brief
    Zhou et al. discovered a specific role of
    adenosine modifications in the coding
    region of mRNAs. These chemical
    alterations slow down the movement of
    the ribosome during translation and
    trigger degradation of the
    corresponding mRNAs.
    
    Highlights
    d
    
    m6A in the coding sequence triggers mRNA degradation via
    CDS-m6A decay (CMD)
    
    d
    
