    Pseudouridylation of Epstein-Barr virus noncoding RNA
    EBER2 facilitates lytic replication
    BELLE A. HENRY,1 VIRGINIE MARCHAND,2 BRENT T. SCHLEGEL,1 MARK HELM,3 YURI MOTORIN,2,4
    and NARA LEE1
    1
    
