    RabbitQCPlus 2.0: More eﬃcient and versatile quality control for
    sequencing data
    Lifeng Yan a , Zekun Yin a,∗ , Hao Zhang a , Zhan Zhao a , Mingkai Wang a , André Müller b ,
    Felix Kallenborn b , Alexander Wichmann b , Yanjie Wei c , Beifang Niu d , Bertil Schmidt b ,
    Weiguo Liu a
    a
    
