    Loss of YTHDC1 m6A reading function promotes invasiveness in
    urothelial carcinoma of the bladder
    Jinyun Xu1, Jonas Koch1, Claudia Schmidt2, Malin Nientiedt3, Manuel Neuberger3, Philipp Erben3, Maurice Stephan Michel3,
