    Structures of aberrant spliceosome
    intermediates on their way to disassembly
    Received: 25 September 2023
    Accepted: 19 December 2024
    
    Komal Soni 1 , Attila Horvath2, Olexandr Dybkov3, Merlin Schwan1,
    Sasanan Trakansuebkul2, Dirk Flemming 1, Klemens Wild 1,
    Henning Urlaub 3,4, Tamás Fischer 2 & Irmgard Sinning 1
    
